#: build/blocks/hours-form/index.js:1 src/blocks/hours-form/index.js:49
msgid "Off: hours are always recorded for today, so nobody can add hours to the past or change a closed period. Administrators and editors can always choose the date."
msgstr "Av: timer registreres alltid for i dag, slik at ingen kan legge til timer bakover i tid eller endre en lukket periode. Administratorer og redaktører kan alltid velge dato."

#: build/blocks/hours-form/index.js:1 src/blocks/hours-form/index.js:45
